  "title": "Zai Lab to Present at 44th Annual J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference",
  "summary": "SHANGHAI & CAMBRIDGE, Mass.–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Jan. 5, 2026–Zai Lab Limited (NASDAQ: ZLAB; HKEX: 9688) today announced that members of the Company’s senior management team will participate in the 44th Annual J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference on Tuesday, January 13th, 2026, at 3:00 p.m. PST / 6:00 p.m. EST. A live webcast of the presentation will be available on […]",
